            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> it's reproducible on this minimal config:\r\n\r\nYes, I can reproduce it with this config. This probably comes from combination of LSP and fallback action. I'll look into it, but I'd guess that this is just the way this is going to work.\r\n\r\n> One thing I like to mention even on recorded screen you send removing character is not quite smooth it's clearly is lagging in comparison to not having a auto completion.\r\n\r\nIt is as smooth as without 'mini.completion'. What might be perceived as lag is either not consistent key strokes or recording artifacts.",
