            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Disabling fallback action indeed is solving the issue but that's where the `callback` is coming from ...\r\n\r\nYeah, true. It could still have been an issue with something 'mini.completion' does explicitly (state tracking, etc.).\r\n\r\nAnother advice might be to increase or decrease the `config.delay.completion` setting. If you experience this issue often, it might so happen that the typing speed doesn't play well with default 100 ms. One case why it was visible in `call` is because it is hard to type smoothly on regular QWERTY keyboard. \r\n\r\nClosing as (there seems like) nothing can be done due to synchronous nature of default fallback.",
