        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I had the same slowness problem for while, was not easy to track it back to this issue\nbasically, with large files, when I type fast, every 10 characters or so, the cursor moves to the command area, freezes and come back to the insert mode after about half a second.\nFixed by disabling the callback action. but not sure what was wrong with my config.\n\nit may be nice to add a note in the documentation about his issue as it may be common.\n\n\n",
            "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:58:45Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/678#issuecomment-3628324937",
